      "created_at": "2016-11-03T21:59:44Z",
      "updated_at": "2016-11-03T21:59:44Z",
      "body": "Currently the bot state api is only used to store internal tracking information for the BOT itself. \n\nDirectLine is a channel and it uses azure table storage with the data encrypted to provide clients ability to get the state of a conversation.  It does not use the bot state api.  Allowing it to have a conversation storage API is good idea and we will add to our enhancement list.\n",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "pin": null,
