      "created_at": "2016-11-03T22:12:23Z",
      "updated_at": "2016-11-03T22:12:23Z",
      "body": "Thanks for your reply. Do we know how long would that data in azure be stored (Also which DataCenter)? Is there a chance we can dictate the datacenter that this storage can take place in the future for legal reasons? Also Does that mean other channels also use their own table storage? \n",
