      "created_at": "2016-11-07T08:24:53Z",
      "updated_at": "2016-11-07T08:25:41Z",
      "body": "Ok...Thank you for your replies. Now it all makes sense. \n\nUnfortunately it is a showstopper for us as data retention  in Directline is a definite no-no. We might spend some time to implement a custom connector and bypass the framework if its easy enough for the time being.\n\nIt would be great if you can keep us updated on this feature.  Thanks\n",
